# Repo-root .dockerignore. Applied to every `docker build` whose context is
# the repo root — currently only the mail-bridge image, which lives at
# apps/mail-bridge/Dockerfile and pulls in ../../packages/sdk-go via a
# go.mod `replace` directive.
#
# Strategy: exclude everything, then un-exclude only the two trees the
# mail-bridge build actually needs. This keeps the build context small
# (~MBs, not GBs) and avoids spurious cache busts when unrelated Worker
# code changes.

# Default-deny.
*

# Mail-bridge source tree + its sibling Go SDK dependency.
!apps
apps/*
!apps/mail-bridge
!packages
packages/*
!packages/sdk-go

# Inside the un-excluded trees, prune build/test artefacts that aren't part
# of the Go module surface.
apps/mail-bridge/bin/
apps/mail-bridge/out/
apps/mail-bridge/*.test
apps/mail-bridge/coverage.out
apps/mail-bridge/coverage.html
apps/mail-bridge/docker-compose*.yml
apps/mail-bridge/README.md
apps/mail-bridge/Dockerfile
apps/mail-bridge/.dockerignore

packages/sdk-go/*.test
packages/sdk-go/coverage.out

# Editor + OS noise (defensive — should already be excluded by the default-deny).
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.git
**/.github
